Percentage of abortions out of total deliveries (2003–2018) and by group (2015–2018)
The overall adolescent pregnancy rate in the two study camps was 118/1,000 women in the 15–19 life years (95% CI 99.3–137.0), with a peak in 2015 of 188/1000 (95% CI 162.0–218.0) (Figure 7). Thailand in comparison had 44.5/1,000.
Figure 7.
