review maternal and perinatal deaths across the Rohingya response and subsequent identification of 
ways to reduce preventable maternal and perinatal deaths. However, the number of maternal and 
perinatal deaths occurring across the response is still unacceptably high with an average of 1 maternal 
death and 15 perinatal deaths occurring per week. 
In previous years, the emphasis of the Maternal and Perinatal Mortality Surveillance and Response 
(MPMSR) system was developed and strengthened for maternal deaths only. However, starting in August 
2023, the surveillance and response system for perinatal deaths was established. The number of 
perinatal deaths reported in this annual report only reflects the perinatal deaths that occurred between 
August and December 2023. 
